<title>INDIA: India 96/97 rice crop seen at 80.53 mln T.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 rice crop seen at 80.53 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Agriculture Ministry on Thursday estimated the 96/97 (June-May) rice crop at 80.53 million tonnes comapred with 79.62 million tonnes the previous year, an official statement said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
